### Health check
GET http://localhost:8081/

### Create an order
POST http://localhost:8081/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "customer-123",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "prod-001",
      "name": "Widget",
      "quantity": 2,
      "price": 29.99
    },
    {
      "productId": "prod-002",
      "name": "Gadget",
      "quantity": 1,
      "price": 49.99
    }
  ],
  "total": 109.97
}

### Get all orders
GET http://localhost:8081/orders

### Get order by ID (replace with actual ID)
GET http://localhost:8081/orders/{{orderId}}

### Cancel order (replace with actual ID)
POST http://localhost:8081/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Customer changed their mind"
}

### View audit events
GET http://localhost:8081/internals/audit

### View registered handlers
GET http://localhost:8081/internals/events

### View status
GET http://localhost:8081/internals/status

### Clear query cache
POST http://localhost:8081/internals/cache/clear
